{"id":"ve_tement","lemma":"vêtement","pos":"noun","rank":835,"glosses":["garment, item of clothing","clothes, clothing","a set of four triangles covering the corners of the shield, leaving a lozenge of the field (the edges of which reach the edges of the shield) in the middle (compare vêtu)"],"ipa":"/vɛt.mɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/86/Fr-v%C3%AAtement.ogg/Fr-v%C3%AAtement.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"vêtements"},"formAudio":{"vêtements":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/57/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-0x010C-v%C3%AAtements.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Elle a beaucoup de vêtements.","en":"She has quite a lot of clothes.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"much, very much, a lot"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Un manteau est un vêtement.","en":"A coat is an article of clothing.","words":[{"g":"a"},{"g":"coat"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Où sont mes vêtements ?","en":"Where are my clothes?","words":[{"g":"where"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"my"},null]},{"text":"Je ne porte aucun sous-vêtement.","en":"I'm not wearing any underwear.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"door"},{"g":"none, no-one"},{"g":"below, under"},null]},{"text":"Prends soin de tes vêtements.","en":"Take care of your clothes.","words":[{"g":"to take","l":"prendre"},{"g":"care"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"your"},null]}]}